    <item>
      <title>Runink PULSE Pricing</title>
      <link>https://runink.org/products/pulse-pricing/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://runink.org/products/pulse-pricing/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;This is the price of Runink PULSE. You pay for each person who uses it, and the seat covers the work that person puts through it. You choose where it runs: on Runink&amp;rsquo;s shared machines, in your own cloud account, or inside your own estate. Writing a second version of a campaign does not add to the price.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;section class=&#34;py-4&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;flex justify-center&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;inline-flex rounded-full bg-sunk p-1.5 border border-stone-800 shadow-inner relative&#34; role=&#34;tablist&#34;&#xA;        aria-label=&#34;Pricing toggle&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;pricing-slider absolute top-1.5 bottom-1.5 left-0 rounded-full bg-signal-fill shadow-md transition-all duration-300 pointer-events-none&#34; style=&#34;width: 0px; transform: translateX(0);&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;        &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34;&#xA;          class=&#34;toggle-btn relative z-10 px-6 py-2.5 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-stone-500 rounded-full transition-colors duration-300 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-signal focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-sunk&#34;&#xA;          data-value=&#34;monthly&#34; role=&#34;tab&#34; aria-selected=&#34;false&#34;&gt;&#xA;          Pay Monthly&#xA;        &lt;/button&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;        &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34;&#xA;          class=&#34;toggle-btn relative z-10 px-6 py-2.5 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-stone-500 rounded-full transition-colors duration-300 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-signal focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-sunk&#34;&#xA;          data-value=&#34;yearly&#34; role=&#34;tab&#34; aria-selected=&#34;false&#34;&gt;&#xA;          Pay Yearly (About 15% Less)&#xA;        &lt;/button&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/section&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;script&gt;&#xA;  (function () {&#xA;    var container = document.currentScript &amp;&amp; document.currentScript.previousElementSibling;&#xA;    if (!container) return;&#xA;    var firstButtonGroup = container.querySelector(&#39;[role=&#34;tablist&#34;]&#39;);&#xA;    if (!firstButtonGroup) return;&#xA;    var buttons = firstButtonGroup.querySelectorAll(&#39;button[data-value]&#39;);&#xA;    if (!buttons.length) return;&#xA;&#xA;    var slider = firstButtonGroup.querySelector(&#39;.pricing-slider&#39;);&#xA;&#xA;    function setActive(val) {&#xA;      document.documentElement.setAttribute(&#39;data-pricing&#39;, val);&#xA;      buttons.forEach(function (btn) {&#xA;        var isActive = btn.getAttribute(&#39;data-value&#39;) === val;&#xA;        btn.setAttribute(&#39;aria-selected&#39;, isActive ? &#39;true&#39; : &#39;false&#39;);&#xA;&#xA;        &#xA;        btn.classList.toggle(&#39;text-on-fill&#39;, isActive);&#xA;        btn.classList.toggle(&#39;text-stone-500&#39;, !isActive);&#xA;        btn.classList.toggle(&#39;hover:text-stone-300&#39;, !isActive);&#xA;&#xA;        if (isActive &amp;&amp; slider) {&#xA;          slider.style.width = btn.offsetWidth + &#39;px&#39;;&#xA;          slider.style.transform = &#39;translateX(&#39; + btn.offsetLeft + &#39;px)&#39;;&#xA;        }&#xA;      });&#xA;&#xA;      &#xA;      try {&#xA;        var evt = new CustomEvent(&#39;pricing:toggle&#39;, { detail: { value: val } });&#xA;        document.dispatchEvent(evt);&#xA;      } catch (e) {   }&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    buttons.forEach(function (btn) {&#xA;      btn.addEventListener(&#39;click&#39;, function () { setActive(btn.getAttribute(&#39;data-value&#39;)); });&#xA;    });&#xA;&#xA;    window.addEventListener(&#39;resize&#39;, function() {&#xA;      var activeBtn = firstButtonGroup.querySelector(&#39;button[aria-selected=&#34;true&#34;]&#39;);&#xA;      if (activeBtn &amp;&amp; slider) {&#xA;        slider.style.width = activeBtn.offsetWidth + &#39;px&#39;;&#xA;        slider.style.transform = &#39;translateX(&#39; + activeBtn.offsetLeft + &#39;px)&#39;;&#xA;      }&#xA;    });&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;    if (buttons.length &gt; 0) {&#xA;      &#xA;      setTimeout(function() {&#xA;        setActive(buttons[0].getAttribute(&#39;data-value&#39;));&#xA;      }, 50);&#xA;    }&#xA;  })();&#xA;&lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;section class=&#34;py-16 relative z-10&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;style&gt;&#xA;        .price-yearly,&#xA;        .freq-yearly,&#xA;        .feature-yearly {&#xA;            display: none !important;&#xA;        }&#xA;&#xA;        [data-pricing=&#34;yearly&#34;] .price-yearly,&#xA;        [data-pricing=&#34;yearly&#34;] .freq-yearly,&#xA;        [data-pricing=&#34;yearly&#34;] .feature-yearly {&#xA;            display: inline-flex !important;&#xA;        }&#xA;&#xA;        [data-pricing=&#34;yearly&#34;] .price-monthly,&#xA;        [data-pricing=&#34;yearly&#34;] .freq-monthly {&#xA;            display: none !important;&#xA;        }&#xA;    &lt;/style&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &#xA;            &#xA;            &#xA;            &#xA;&#xA;            &#xA;            &#xA;&#xA;            &#xA;            &#xA;            &#xA;            &#xA;            &#xA;            &#xA;&#xA;            &#xA;            &#xA;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&#34;w-full&#34;&gt;&#xA;                &#xA;                &#xA;                &lt;div&#xA;                    class=&#34;rk-plan h-full flex flex-col rounded-lg border shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 border-stone-800 bg-sheet&#34;&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;div class=&#34;p-8 lg:p-12 flex flex-col flex-grow items-center text-center&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;                        &#xA;                        &#xA;                        &lt;div class=&#34;mb-8&#34;&gt;&#xA;                            &lt;span&#xA;                                class=&#34;inline-block font-black text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] italic border-stone-800 text-stone-500&#34;&gt;&#xA;                                ON RUNINK&amp;#39;S SHARED MACHINES&#xA;                            &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;                        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                        &#xA;&#xA;                        &#xA;                        &lt;h3&#xA;                            class=&#34;text-4xl xl:text-5xl font-black italic tracking-tighter uppercase mb-2 break-words w-full text-white&#34;&gt;&#xA;                            LITE LICENCE&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;                        &lt;p class=&#34;text-[10px] font-bold text-stone-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-12&#34;&gt;FOR TEAMS OF 1 TO 9 PEOPLE&#xA;                        &lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Runink TIDE Pricing</title>
      <link>https://runink.org/products/tide-pricing/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://runink.org/products/tide-pricing/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-4&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;text-xl text-stone-300 mb-6 font-medium leading-relaxed&#34;&gt;&#xA;        This is the price of Runink TIDE: Trusted Intelligence for Developer &amp;amp; Data Experience. You choose where it runs: on Runink&amp;#39;s shared machines, priced per person; in your own cloud account, priced per node; or on your own premises, priced with you. There is no second bill: TIDE never takes a percentage of anything it finds, fixes or ships, because an audit record or a deploy pipeline is not the kind of thing a success fee should attach to.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
