      <link>https://runink.org/products/pulse/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://runink.org/products/pulse/</guid>
      <description>&lt;section class=&#34;relative overflow-hidden py-24 md:py-32&#34; style=&#34;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--rk-sunk),var(--rk-ground))&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;container relative z-10&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;            &#xA;            &lt;div class=&#34;lg:col-span-6 space-y-8 relative&#34;&gt;&#xA;                &#xA;                &lt;div&#xA;                    class=&#34;absolute -top-20 -left-20 w-64 h-64 bg-signal-fill/20 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none opacity-50&#34;&gt;&#xA;                &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;                &lt;h1 class=&#34;text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold leading-normal text-white tracking-normal drop-shadow-xl&#34;&gt;&#xA;                    The lead who wrote at nine at night bought from whoever answered first.&#xA;                &lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&#xA;                &lt;p&#xA;                    class=&#34;text-xl text-ink-2 leading-relaxed drop-shadow-md border-l-4 border-signal pl-6&#34;&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;strong&gt;Runink PULSE: Prescriptive Unified Lead &amp;amp; Social Engine.&lt;/strong&gt; Marketing software your own team runs. It finds the companies worth calling, drafts the reply, the campaign and the follow-up, and shows which channel brings customers in. Your team decides what goes out. You pay per seat, not per tool.&#xA;                &lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
